# Story page: nm-frost
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Whiteout
---
The snow came down so thick that the fjord forgot where the water ended.

{name} slid from ice to ice to ice, choosing every turn long before it came, like a chess player who has only ever lost.

'You cannot steer the world,' said the coil. 'Only choose where you'll be when it stops.' Then the ice cracked, and so did I.
